st quickly  next slides are  the next day you'll see me again i'll be  doing a welcoming recap of today um then  there will be a panel for government  agencies call to action we'll be doing  another panel called putting skin in the  game the economic opportunity and then  there will be a lunch break  after the break for 45 minutes we'll  join back here again all of these um all  the panels will be hosted in the  auditorium so i just want to reflect  that and make sure everyone knows that  and that will be the society's promise  for improved science cultures a  scientific opportunity and then we will  have you guys join us back into the  breakout rooms for breakout session two  that's entitled the scientific  enterprise  the last panel of the day will be  creating synergistic partnerships the  power of working together one of our  themes and one of the major parts of  while we're here  well after that we'll have a small break  and then there will be report out so you  can actually hear and learn what  happened in the other breakout sessions  i want to just reflect that for the  breakouts we're asking for the first day  that you please join based on the  affiliation that you are as far as your  job or career  um and then for the second day whatever  close your boat whatever you feel that  you want to join into and hear and  listen into please feel free to join  that web webinar or that link um on the  next day so if you have any questions  obviously please go throughout the  health desk because that is also there  to help anyone that needs anything  and  on that note i'm going to turn it back  over again enjoy the meeting i hope you  all enjoy it i hope you guys could  return it and i'm grateful that you all  are here so with that i'm going to end  and say thanks
 

